  "description": "Shared Graph + Azure.Identity wiring that the Microsoft Entra adapter family (VisuAuth.Entra for Workforce, VisuAuth.EntraExternal for Customer / External ID) builds on. Hosts the no-op fallbacks for IAuditWriter / IJwtIssuer / ITenantContext / IExternalLoginFlow that an Entra-only deployment needs when the consumer has not wired the Identity adapter, plus the CSPRNG temporary-password generator. Consumers normally never reference this package directly — install VisuAuth.Entra or VisuAuth.EntraExternal, which pull this in transitively.",
